## 4. Delivered Test Architecture

### 4.1 Dev dependencies

| Package | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `bloc_test` | `blocTest`, `whenListen` |
| `mocktail` | Null-safe mocks (preferred over Mockito in modern Dart) |
| `golden_toolkit` | Visual regression |
| `integration_test` (SDK) | Device-level journey tests |

### 4.2 Harness

| Artifact | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `test/helpers/pump_app.dart` | Material/Get/theme/ScreenUtil setup + Bloc providers |
| `test/helpers/mocks.dart` | Shared mocks and `registerFallbackValue` |
| `test/flutter_test_config.dart` | Golden font bootstrap |
| `.cursor/rules/flutter-testing.mdc` | Convention enforcement for tooling and humans |
| `TESTING.md` | Operator runbook |

### 4.3 Structural mirroring

`lib/` is mirrored under `test/` (e.g. `governorates_cubit.dart` → `governorates_cubit_test.dart`) for discoverability.

### 4.4 Implemented test categories

| Level | Examples | Verification style |
|---|---|---|
| Unit: Cubit | Ads, Contact, Governorates, Nav | initial / success / failure / `seed` + multi-act / `verify` |
| Unit: Bloc | SettlementBloc | event → states + repository `verify` |
| Unit: Repository / Model | GovernoratesRepository, ContactModel | success, failure, `fromJson`/`toJson` |
| Widget | ContactInfoScreen | loading / list / error + retry |
| Golden | Contact loading | Visual baseline (to be replaced, see §11) |
| Integration (scaffold) | `integration_test/app_test.dart` | Journey smoke (device required) |

### 4.5 Minimal production seams (non-breaking)

- Optional `ApiService` injection in `GovernoratesRepository`
- Optional `ContactCubit` injection in `ContactInfoScreen`
- Retry action in the error state (behaviorally verifiable)
- Value equality for `ContactData` to support `Equatable` states

These follow the principle of testability as a first-class design concern.

