## 9. Risk Register

| ID | Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| T-01 | Large untested Cubit/Bloc surface | High | High | Prioritize auth, checkout, bookings, office cars/orders |
| T-02 | Blocs coupled to `sl()` inside handlers | High | High | Constructor-inject use cases; keep `GetIt` at the composition root. Prerequisite for testing `OfficeCarsBloc` and `BookingBloc` |
| T-03 | GetX `.tr` / ScreenUtil in widgets | Medium | Low | Always use the `pumpApp` harness |
| T-04 | Golden flake across fonts/OS | Medium | Medium | Load fonts explicitly; generate and compare goldens on Linux CI only |
| T-05 | Integration tests blocked locally | Medium | Medium | Document `-d <device>`; add a CI Android emulator job |
| T-06 | Coverage number without meaning | Medium | Medium | Enforce thresholds on the state layer first, raise gradually |
| T-07 | Analyzer warnings accumulating | Medium | Low | Fail CI on new warnings against a recorded baseline |

